<title>UK: NNPC crude sales unit completes move to Abuja.</title>
<headline>NNPC crude sales unit completes move to Abuja.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian National Petroleum Corp said on Tuesday it had completed the relocation of its crude oil sales department from Lagos to the Nigerian capital Abuja.</p>
<p>Nigeria, a member of OPEC, is one of the world's largest oil exporters, selling some 1.7 million barrels a day (bpd) of its 2.1 million bpd output.</p>
<p>NNPC's crude sales department, headed by group general manager Taiwo Idemudia, is now based at 42 Usama Street, Cadastral Zone A5, Maitama District, Abuja.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
